Where should an event from $1980$ be placed?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.9]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.6,0); \foreach \x/\yr in {0/1950,1.5/1960,3/1970,4.5/1980,6/1990} {\draw (\x,-0.15)--(\x,0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\yr$};}
\node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (1.5,0.2) {$A$}; \node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (3,0.2) {$B$}; \node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (4.5,0.2) {$C$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The labelled ticks are $20$ years apart. Where does $1910$ belong?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=1.0]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(6.4,0); \foreach \x/\yr in {0/1880,2/1900,4/1920,6/1940} {\draw (\x,-0.15)--(\x,0.15); \node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,-0.15) {$\yr$};}
\node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (2.5,0.2) {$A$}; \node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (3,0.2) {$B$}; \node[above,font=\scriptsize] at (4,0.2) {$C$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
